        "title": "Effects of oral kaempferol on the pharmacokinetics of tamoxifen and one of its metabolites, 4-hydroxytamoxifen, after oral administration of tamoxifen to rats.",
        "authorString": "Piao Y, Shin SC, Choi JS.",
        "authorList": {
